  "description": "<p>This task is to remove the duplicate headers found when performing a GET request on binary resources.<br/>\nTo reproduce:</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>Create a binary resource (<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/image\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/image</a>)</li>\n\t<li>curl -i localhost:8080/rest/image -o image.out</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>Inspect image.out for duplicated headers:</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>ETag</li>\n\t<li>Last-Modified</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n",
